<title>EGYPT: Egypt offers 182-day bills worth 700 million. [CORRECTED 08:29 GMT]</title>
<headline>Egypt offers 182-day bills worth 700 million. [CORRECTED 08:29 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Egyptian treasury offered 182-day treasury bills worth 700 million pounds for auction on January 13 and issue on January 14. (Corrects to show issue is on January 14, not December 14.)</p>
<p>The average yield at the last auction was 10.060 percent.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.40 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
